Subject: Re: [patch 07/18] s390/syscall: Use
 enter_from_user_mode_randomize_stack()
Message-ID: <ak_rx2gFCLtG-Qpy@li-1a3e774c-28e4-11b2-a85c-acc9f2883e29.ibm.com>
